><strong>QuPath 0.7.0</strong></a>."}, {"line": 96, "text": "To read up on the latest changes, check out the <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/qupath/qupath/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">release notes</a></p>"}, {"line": 97, "text": "<section id=\"quick-links\">"}, {"line": 98, "text": "<h2>Quick links<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#quick-links\" title=\"Link to this heading\"></a></h2>"}, {"line": 99, "text": "<dl class=\"simple myst\">"}, {"line": 100, "text": "<dt>Can’t install QuPath?</dt><dd><p>Check out <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"docs/intro/installation.html#installation\"><span class=\"std std-ref\">Installation</span></a> for instructions &amp; solutions to common problems</p>"}, {"line": 101, "text": "</dd>"}, {"line": 102, "text": "<dt>Images won’t open?</dt><dd><p>See <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"docs/intro/formats.html#supported-image-formats\"><span class=\"std std-ref\">Supported image formats</span></a> to find out which formats <em>should</em> work - and ways to increase this.</p>"}, {"line": 103, "text": "</dd>"}, {"line": 104, "text": "<dt>Not sure where to begin?</dt><dd><p>See <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"docs/starting/first_steps.html#first-steps\"><span class=\"std std-ref\">First steps</span></a> for a quick guide, before heading to <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"docs/tutorials/index.html#tutorials\"><span class=\"std std-ref\">Tutorials</span></a> for more details &amp; videos</p>"}, {"line": 105, "text": "</dd>"}, {"line": 106, "text": "<dt>Got more questions?</dt><dd><p>The <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://forum.image.sc/tag/qupath\">Scientific Community Image Forum</a> is the best place to discuss QuPath with users &amp; developers</p>"}, {"line": 107, "text": "</dd>"}, {"line": 108, "text": "</dl>"}, {"line": 109, "text": "</section>"}, {"line": 110, "text": "<section id=\"full-contents\">"}, {"line": 111, "text": "<h2>Full contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#fu